# Smartling

> Smartling is a cloud-based translation management system (TMS) and language services provider that helps enterprises translate and localize websites, software, marketing content, and support content. The platform combines AI-powered translation, machine translation, and professional human linguists with automation, quality assurance, and analytics tools, and integrates with 50+ CMS, code, and marketing platforms.

Smartling serves enterprise localization, marketing, developer/product, and customer support teams across industries including eCommerce/retail, software, healthcare, and hospitality. Core differentiators: end-to-end automation (up to 99% of the translation process), AI translation backed by human linguist review, and enterprise-grade security/compliance (SOC 2, HIPAA, PCI DSS, GDPR, ISO 17100/9001/42001).

